{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ad choices icon ad choices icon","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md","fileName":"AdChoices Icon.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AdChoices Icon","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-17 09:48\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Mobile Commerce Privacy Behavior]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Mobile Commerce Privacy Behavior","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ad choices icon ad choices icon","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md","fileName":"AdChoices Icon.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AdChoices Icon","heading":"AdChoices Icon","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The AdChoices icon is a notice attached to behaviorally targeted advertising that is intended to signal data-based personalization and provide access to information or choices. It attempts to make an otherwise hidden advertising process visible at the point of use.\n\nIts effectiveness depends on recognition and comprehension. A symbol cannot support meaningful control when users do not know what it means, what tracking produced the ad, or what an offered opt-out changes.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Mobile Commerce Privacy Behavior","frontiersofdatascience.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ad choices icon ad choices icon","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AdChoices Icon.md","fileName":"AdChoices Icon.md","folder":"6 - Full